 "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le06ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "People-Oriented Roles</br></br><ul><li>Coordinators are traditional team leaders in that they guide the team to what they recognize are the objectives. They are excellent listeners for they are able to recognize the value of each team member. They are calm, good-natured and show that they can delegate tasks very effectively. They may be manipulative at times insofar as they may delegate away too much personal responsibility.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le06ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "24000", "text": "<ul><li>Resource investigators can be described as stable, dominant and extroverted. It's noticed that they are the most immediately likeable member of the team. Their responses tend to be positive and enthusiastic, inasmuch as they are prone to put things down as quickly as they take them up. They are the member of the team who goes outside the team and brings information, ideas and developments back to it. They are quick to see the relevance of new ideas. Within the team, they are good improvisers in that they work well under pressure, but can over-relax when it eases.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le06ob06re2img06.jpg"}, {"time": "56000", "text": "<ul><li>Team workers can be described as stable, extroverted and low in dominance. The team worker is the most sensitive of the team. A team worker is the most aware of individuals' needs and worries. They also know most about the private lives and family affairs of the rest of the team inasmuch as they are the most active internal communicator. A team worker is likeable, popular, unassertive, the cement of the team. If someone produces an idea, their instinct is to build upon it, rather than demolish it. They are good listeners and communicate freely and well within the team. They also help everyone and feel that others should do the same. They dislike personal confrontation insofar as they tend to try and avoid it themselves and among others. However, their uncompetitiveness and dislike of confrontation may make them seem a bit soft and indecisive.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le06ob06re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le06ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le06ob06re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}]}]}